# Kernel config fragment: Debian 13 amd64 project-specific overrides.
#
# This file is merged on top of:
#   1. The Debian 13 stock kernel .config (from apt-get source linux).
#   2. configs/hardened-overlay.config (linux-hardened defaults).
#
# Any option set here must have a corresponding entry in configs/POLICY.md.
#
# This file is intentionally empty as of Phase 1. Project-specific overrides
# (e.g. enabling a feature this target needs that hardened-overlay disabled,
# or further tightening a Debian default) belong here.
